y the real Joker multiple  times in the process perhaps  surprisingly she survived the experience  after the injuries she suffered in no  man's land  Hellena Bertinelli made a full recovery  man so did her relationship with Barbara  Gordon for a while as Oracle Barbara  founded a team of her own called birds  of prey coordinated missions with other  super heroines as her operatives having  felt aimless four years after her  experiences in no man's land the  Huntress joined up alongside Oracle and  Black Canary  the camaraderie of the team seemed to be  doing a lot of good for Helena allowing  her to move past the anger and desire  for revenge that had driven her since  she was a child  unfortunately it was short-lived after a  few adventures with the birds she  realized that Oracle had been sending  her on missions designed to teach her  lessons and push her towards  self-improvement  treating her the same way a teacher  might handle a problem student  infuriated at being manipulated by yet  another member of the Batman family who  seemed to want to mold her into what  they wanted her to be she ditched the  team and left in 2002 the WB launched a  birds-of-prey TV show loosely and that's  the key word here based on the comic of  the same name are you I'm the Huntress  and you're the prey the show focused on  two heroines the first was Barbara  Gordon played by dina meyer who had been  Batgirl until she was shot by the Joker  and had reinvented herself as Oracle the  second as though things weren't  complicated enough already was Helene a  Kyle played by Ashley Scott's like the  original earth to Huntress  he was the daughter of Batman and  Catwoman heavily implied to be the  version seen on the big screen in Batman  Returns  unlike Hellena Wayne however this  version never knew her father with  Catwoman keeping her birthday secret  from Batman still after Batman's  apparent - she took the identity of the  Huntress and carried on his legacy  alongside Barbara protecting a younger  version of Black Canary Dinah Lance the  show only lasted a single 13 episodes  season before it was canceled it did  have some interesting ideas however  including casting a version of Harley  Quinn as the main villain of the series  marking one of the first time she'd  stepped out of the Joker's shadow  very pleased it's Harley Harley Quinn  and quite soon this city but what's left  of it will be mine it wasn't entirely  forgotten either seventeen years after  the last episode aired and only weeks  before the Huntress made it to the big  screen in the birds of prey movie Ashley  Scott returned to the role for a cameo  in CW's crisis on Infinite Earths  crossover check out one of our newest  videos right here plus even more looper  videos about your favorite superheroes  are coming soon subscribe to our YouTube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]

